  "issue": {
    "body": "The `QueryParams` and `Headers` multidict classes' `__iter__` method returns key/value pairs instead of just keys which is what I would expect from a Python mapping.\r\n\r\nI haven't seen an implementation like this and checked a few from Django, Werkzeug, urllib3, and aio-lib's multidict.\r\n\r\nWas this intentional or should it be changed?\r\n\r\nThanks!",
